<title>UK: EIB sets three IBEX-35 linked peseta bonds. [corrected 12:05 gmt]</title>
<headline>EIB sets three IBEX-35 linked peseta bonds. [corrected 12:05 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to show that the bonds are public offerings and not private placements)</p>
<p>The European Investment Bank has issued three 3.5 billion peseta IBEX-35 linked bonds, lead manager La Caixa Barcelona said on Thursday. Details of how the redemption values will be calculated were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The deals mature on June 5, 6 and 7, 2000 respectively.</p>
<p>All were priced at 100.10 with 0.10 point fees.</p>
<p>The payment date is December 19.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
